    "Galio isn't endorsed by Riot Games and doesn't reflect the views or opinions of Riot Games or anyone officially involved in producing or managing Riot Games properties. Riot Games, and all associated properties are trademarks or registered trademarks of Riot Games, Inc.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Galio isn't endorsed by Riot Games and doesn't reflect the views or opinions of Riot Games or anyone officially involved in producing or managing Riot Games properties. Riot Games, and all associated properties are trademarks or registered trademarks of Riot Games, Inc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Galio oyuna asla tuş basmaz veya tıklamaz, oyun belleğini okumaz, gizli bilgi ve diğer oyuncuların istatistiklerini göstermez. Güçlendirmelerde kazanma oranı değil yalnızca seviye (S–D) gösterilir. Rün ve eşya seti aktarımı sadece senin tıklamanla, oyun dışında yapılır.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Galio never presses keys or clicks in the game, never reads game memory, and never shows hidden information or other players' stats. Augments show tiers (S–D) only, never win rates. Rune and item-set import only happens when you click, outside the live game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
